---
manual: styles.class_wide
lines: [1022, 1024]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: M35
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 200 do
  style(Shoes::Para, family: "monospace")
  flow { @thin = para "iiiiii", size: 20 }
  flow { @wide = para "WWWWWW", size: 20 }
end
----------- test code
assert_in_delta layout_of(para("@thin")).w, layout_of(para("@wide")).w, 0.5, "every paragraph got the class-wide monospace font, so i and W are equally wide"
